  "name": "cvd",
  "$comment": "Colour-blind. A THEME, not a special case \u2014 the same tokens, different hues, so nothing else in the style changes.\nRed/green is the pair a deuteranope cannot separate, and it is exactly the pair carrying 'closed' and 'open'. Blue/orange survives every common form. The words survive regardless: statusWord() is what actually carries the answer, and this only changes what colour it arrives in.\nBefore this existed the app offered the setting and then handed the MAP the light theme anyway, so the one user who chose it because they cannot tell red from green got a red/green map.",
